say 69 'By then, the clip had left London.'
say 72 'In Jamaica, dancehall star Vybz Kartel posted that "Low budget v-word" was his new song. Spice asked whether she should make one too.'
say 74 'On The View, Whoopi Goldberg introduced it by admitting she hadn'\''t known they had Real Housewives in London.'
say 75 'And Peacock put the whole second season up in America.'
