say 77 'There was, she wrote, "absolutely nothing low-budget about the estimated twelve-million-pound property".'
say 78 'As for Season Three, nothing has been announced.'
say 79 'The Sun reports that producers want to "shake things up", and that some of the cast are scared for their places.'
say 80 'Karen, for her part, has nothing to worry about. She has five other front doors.'
say 81 'So here'\''s how it ends. A building put up around 1700 for horses and carriages became a twelve-million-pound home.'
say 82 'And then, in one sentence, it became the most famous house in reality television.'
say 83 'The funny part? Back in 2025, during that HELLO! photo shoot, Amanda made a prediction about Season Two.'
